	<section_number>3.2-1722</section_number>
	<catch_line>Falsification of records; misdemeanor</catch_line>
	<text>
		It is a Class 1 misdemeanor:
		<section prefix="1">For any manufacturer to fail to submit to the Department any report required pursuant to § 3.2-1719 within 60 days after the time such report is due.
		</section>
		<section prefix="2">For any manufacturer knowingly to report falsely to the Department any information required pursuant to this article.
		</section>
	</text>
	<history>2005, cc. 497, 588, § 3.1-22.77; 2008, c. 860.</history>
